    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A perfect blend of tapping fun and poker hands!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a thrilling mix of clicker gameplay and poker hands! In Poker Clicker, you earn chips based on the strength of randomly generated poker hands - from a simple high card to the elusive royal flush. Each tap of the Joker card reveals a new hand, bringing you closer to the ultimate jackpot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earned chips to purchase gems or poker hand updates that unlock special bonuses and accelerate your progress towards higher scores. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet addictive gameplay - perfect for poker enthusiasts and casual players alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic scoring system based on poker hand rankings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gem Shop - boost your performance and maximise your winnings!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish graphics and intuitive interface for a seamless experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't forget, every click gets you one step closer to unlock one of 30 unique Joker Card designs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And don't worry if you're not getting any goals or feeling like you're missing a strategy. It's all about the endless clicking, and it's the perfect way to relax and unwind.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A perfect blend of tapping fun and poker hands!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a thrilling mix of clicker gameplay and poker hands! In Poker Clicker, you earn chips based on the strength of randomly generated poker hands - from a simple high card to the elusive royal flush. Each tap of the Joker card reveals a new hand, bringing you closer to the ultimate jackpot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earned chips to purchase gems or poker hand updates that unlock special bonuses and accelerate your progress towards higher scores. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet addictive gameplay - perfect for poker enthusiasts and casual players alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic scoring system based on poker hand rankings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gem Shop - boost your performance and maximise your winnings!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish graphics and intuitive interface for a seamless experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't forget, every click gets you one step closer to unlock one of 30 unique Joker Card designs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And don't worry if you're not getting any goals or feeling like you're missing a strategy. It's all about the endless clicking, and it's the perfect way to relax and unwind.</strong></p>",
